{"4498620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Operation: All Out", "steam_appid": 4498620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operation: All Out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation: All Out is a single player third person shooter where survival depends on smart shooting, limited ammo, and finding medical kits and ammo kits in the camps while eliminating enimies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A devastating terrorist attack has shaken the nation. Cities burn, lives are lost, and the enemy hides deep within fortified camps across hostile territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an unknown agent, a soldier with no name and no history—only a mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is simple: infiltrate enemy strongholds, eliminate every terrorist threat, and deliver justice.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498620/extras/99cd4857172d22d10d1cd7693560fe92.poster.avif?t=1777371279\" width=1170 height=638 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498620/extras/99cd4857172d22d10d1cd7693560fe92.webm?t=1777371279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498620/extras/99cd4857172d22d10d1cd7693560fe92.mp4?t=1777371279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Operation: All Out</i>, you will penetrate heavily guarded camps, fight through dangerous environments, and take down the forces responsible for the attack on your country. Every mission pushes you deeper into enemy territory where survival depends on your skill, strategy, and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy is organized, ruthless, and ready for war. But you are something worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the one coming for them.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operation: All Out</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operation: All Out is a single player third person shooter where survival depends on smart shooting, limited ammo, and finding medical kits and ammo kits in the camps while eliminating enimies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A devastating terrorist attack has shaken the nation. Cities burn, lives are lost, and the enemy hides deep within fortified camps across hostile territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an unknown agent, a soldier with no name and no history—only a mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your objective is simple: infiltrate enemy strongholds, eliminate every terrorist threat, and deliver justice.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498620/extras/99cd4857172d22d10d1cd7693560fe92.poster.avif?t=1777371279\" width=1170 height=638 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498620/extras/99cd4857172d22d10d1cd7693560fe92.webm?t=1777371279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4498620/extras/99cd4857172d22d10d1cd7693560fe92.mp4?t=1777371279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Operation: All Out</i>, you will penetrate heavily guarded camps, fight through dangerous environments, and take down the forces responsible for the attack on your country. Every mission pushes you deeper into enemy territory where survival depends on your skill, strategy, and precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy is organized, ruthless, and ready for war. But you are something worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the one coming for them.</p>", "short_description": "Operation: All Out is a single player third person shooter where survival depends on smart shooting, limited ammo, and finding m